## Enforcing this mechanically

If part of this needs a repeatable checklist an agent applies whenever
it creates a new module/table/component (e.g. a scaffolding checklist,
a structural invariant like a required isolation pattern), write it as
a project-specific Skill under `.claude/skills/` — see
`skill-authoring/SKILL.md` for the format. This framework ships none
by default; what belongs here is entirely a property of your project's
actual architecture, not something a generic template should presume.
